registration.dashboard.title = Register your nominated company
registration.dashboard.heading = Register your nominated company

registration.dashboard.p1 = Choose the UK company that will submit SAO notifications and certificates for the companies in your organisation. This is called your nominated company.
registration.dashboard.p2 = You only need to register once for your organisation. If your organisation has more than one SAO, you can use the same account for all SAOs or register separately to create a different account for each one.

registration.dashboard.row.company = Enter your nominated company details
registration.dashboard.row.contacts = Enter your contact details

registration.dashboard.row.status.notStarted = Not started
registration.dashboard.row.status.cannotStartYet = Cannot start yet
registration.dashboard.row.status.completed = Completed

registration.dashboard.submit = Submit your registration

registration.complete.heading = Registration complete
registration.complete.referenceNumberPrefix = Your reference number
registration.complete.p1 = We’ve sent a confirmation email to all the contacts you gave during registration.
registration.complete.p2 = if you want to keep a paper record of your registration.
registration.complete.h2 = What happens next
registration.complete.p3 = You can now {0} to submit a notification and certificate.
registration.complete.homepageLink = go to your account homepage
registration.complete.print = Print this page
registration.complete.continue = Continue

contactDetailsGuidance.caption = Contact details
contactDetailsGuidance.heading = Provide contact details for your nominated company
contactDetailsGuidance.p1 = You need to provide the contact details of the person or team who will submit your company’s SAO notification and certificate.
contactDetailsGuidance.p2 = We’ll use these details to:
contactDetailsGuidance.b1 = contact you if we have any questions about your SAO submission
contactDetailsGuidance.b2 = send you confirmation when your registration is complete and when you submit your notification and certificate
contactDetailsGuidance.p3 = You can add up to 2 contacts. For each one, provide their full name and email address.

contact.first.caption = First contact details
contact.second.caption = Second contact details

contactName.heading = What is the name of the person or team we can contact?
contactName.hint = For example, ‘Ashley Smith’ or ‘Tax team’
contactName.checkYourAnswersLabel = Full name
contactName.error.required = Enter the name of the person or team we can contact
contactName.error.length = Name of the person or team must be 105 characters or less
contactName.change.first.hidden = change the full name
contactName.error.invalidChars = Name of the person or team must not include <, >, or "
contactName.change.second.hidden = change the full name

contactEmail.title.first  = First contact details
contactEmail.title.second = Second contact details
contactEmail.title.third  = Third contact details
contactEmail.heading = What is the email address for this contact?
contactEmail.hint = We’ll use this to send confirmations and contact this person about the submission if needed.
contactEmail.checkYourAnswersLabel = Email address
contactEmail.error.required = Enter the email address of a person or team
contactEmail.error.length = Email address must be 254 characters or less
contactEmail.error.format = Email address must be in the correct format, like name@example.com
contactEmail.change.first.hidden = change the email address
contactEmail.change.second.hidden = change the email address

contactHaveYouAddedAll.title = First contact details
contactHaveYouAddedAll.caption = Contact details
contactHaveYouAddedAll.heading = Add another contact
contactHaveYouAddedAll.hint = You can add up to 2 contacts. A second contact means we can still email you if we cannot reach the first.
contactHaveYouAddedAll.subheading = Do you want to add another contact?
contactHaveYouAddedAll.yes = Yes
